ntement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Le footing, c'est l'entraînement où tu dois être \"facile\", en totale aisance respiratoire pour être dans la bonne zone de travail et que ce soit efficace, ne l'oublie jamais ! Courir trop vite en footing est l'erreur la plus courante et souvent un des freins majeurs de la progression !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_17","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":326,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":17,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":211,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Indif_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":339,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1794182400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1200},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1020,"pace":{"value":326}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":339}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":339}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":339}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"Competition_M","description":"Le mot du jour : gestion. La course sera suffisamment longue pour que chaque erreur de rythme se paie plus tard. Prends le temps de trouver ton allure dès le départ et n'hésite pas à marcher dans les montées les plus raides si cela te permet d'économiser ton énergie. Pense à boire et à t'alimenter régulièrement, sans attendre les premiers signes de fatigue. Aujourd'hui, ce n'est pas le plus rapide au départ qui sera récompensé, mais celui ou celle qui saura rester efficace jusqu'au bout. Sois patient(e), régulier(ère) et profite du terrain.","displayName":"Jour de course","coachAdvice":"L'équipe CAMPUS te souhaite bon courage pour ta compétition ! On est tous derrière toi :)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Competition","trainingCategory":"trail_competition","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"course","value":420,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z1","abstract":true,"slug":"race","context":"intensity","perception":"target"},"durations":[{"value":14700,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":5,"trainingIndex":3,"weekDate":1794182400000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a68a3c9ba18ec4605331ca9","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1794182400000,"sessionIndex":3,"choRecommendation":6,"formSuggestions":["semi-liquid","liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[],"commercial":[]},"2":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"AdSspNUrTa-cUILb7xt